<title>USA: Jackson Hewitt names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Jackson Hewitt names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>VIRGINIA BEACH, Va. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jackson Hewitt Inc said Wednesday it had named President and Chief Executive Keith Alessi to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>As chairman, Alessi succeeds John Hewitt, the company's founder.</p>
<p>Hewitt announced last month that he would be leaving the company to &quot;pursue other interests.&quot; He remain a member of the board.</p>
<p>Jackson Hewitt is an income tax preparation firm.</p>
